# Rootcellar Deep (CIPlay rootcellar_deep - played after Upfall Orchard, whose four apple baskets it takes; alone:
# rootcellar_deep_solo): 25 m down; the well bottom, the cellar diary, the cellar hatch (the apples), the cellar's air,
# the cellar chest, the root cave (puffers) and its cache.
island Rootcellar Deep
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Other Half
zone well_bottom
expect step 1
read Cellar diary
expect step 2
use cellardoor
expect story cellaropen 1
expect step 3
air cellar
expect step 4
open Cellar chest
wait 3
expect step 5
zone root_cave
kill Puffer fish
expect step 6
open Root cave cache
wait 3
expect done
